# Supabase CLI scratch state: which project this machine is linked to, and the
# server versions it last saw. Rewritten by `supabase link` and most other CLI
# commands, so tracking it means diffs nobody asked for. Nothing here is needed
# to build — the app reads .env. A fresh clone re-creates it with
# `supabase link --project-ref <ref>`. Migrations stay tracked.
supabase/.temp/